  "description": "Before copying production over a sandbox, snapshot what is specific to the sandbox: flows, business rules and plugin steps on/off, environment variables, user and team roles, theme, SharePoint sites, configuration tables. After the copy, compare, then restore only the differences you tick; environment settings are compared only. Publisher prefix filtering keeps Microsoft components out.",
