  "releaseNotes": "1.2026.10.5: actions in the toolbar only, enabled per tab; a message bar shows the next step and warnings (old snapshot, trigger URLs, snapshot of another environment).\n1.2026.10.4: connection badge on the row of the tabs, more room for the content.\n1.2026.10.3: no local build path in the assembly.\n1.2026.10.2: the Help button opens the online documentation.\n1.2026.10.1: first release: snapshot of a sandbox before a production copy, comparison after the copy, restore of the ticked differences, items to do manually.",
